O2 saturation levels were periodically checked during the measurements, and incubation time was adjusted to avoid O2 supersaturation in the chamber, which can inhibit photosynthesis and involve pH changes54,76. GP response to PAR was analysed using the Jassby & Platt model77,78 with SigmaPlot for Windows (version 14.0, 2017 Systat Software, Inc.). Maximum photosynthetic rate (Pm; µmolO2 gDW−1 h−1) and photosynthetic efficiency (α; µmolO2 gDW−1 h−1/µmol photons m−2 s−1) were calculated from the Jassby & Platt fit model, and the half-saturation irradiance (Ik; µmol photons m−2 s−1) was calculated according to the following equation:3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
